@startuml
title PeaPod - Global States and Callbacks

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
hide empty members

' Cross-diagram references (see FSM docs in ../lib/I2CIP/lib/FiniteStateMachine/docs)
package "FSM" {
  class Flag
  class Variable
!if %not(%variable_exists("$CHRONOS_DEFINED"))
!$CHRONOS_DEFINED = 1
  object Chronos <<global instance>>
!endif
}

' Cross-diagram references (see ../lib/I2CIP/docs/uml-module.puml)
package "I2CIP Namespace" {
  object RuntimeAPI
}

package "PeaPod" {
  object "Global States" as GlobalStates {
    cycle : Variable (loop counter)
    fps : Variable (moving average)
    --
    air_temperature : Variable
    air_humidity : Variable
    air_co2 : Variable
    --
    enable_watering : Flag
    --
    adc_voltage : Variable
    pwm_lighting_red : Variable
    pwm_lighting_blue : Variable
    enable_lighting : Flag
    enable_camera : Flag
  }

  object "Core Callbacks" as CoreCallbacks {
    registerCallbacks(): void
    configRouter(command: JsonObject, out: Print): void
    --
    callback_cycle(Number)
    callback_heartbeat(fsm_timestamp_t)
    callback_module<M,T>(fsm_timestamp_t)
    --
    callback_temperature(Number)
    callback_humidity(Number)
    callback_co2(Number)
    callback_adc_read<F,C>(fsm_timestamp_t)
    callback_adc_voltage(Number)
  }

  object "Device Write Callbacks" as DeviceCallbacks {
    callback_mcp23017_digitalWrite<F,P>(bool)
    callback_pca9685_analogWrite<F,P>(Number)
    callback_pca9685_onOff<F,P>(bool)
  }

  object "Onboard GPIO Helpers" as GpioHelpers {
    controlPin<P>(s: bool)
    controlPWM<P>(v: uint8_t | Number)
    --
    pinModeSet: bool[255]
  }
}

object DebugJson <<library>>

GlobalStates ..> CoreCallbacks : conditionals trigger
CoreCallbacks ..> Chronos : Chronos.set(millis())\n+ addInterval()
CoreCallbacks ..> RuntimeAPI : DebugJson::update ->\ncommandRouter/configRouter
CoreCallbacks ..> DebugJson : heartbeat/telemetry/revision
GlobalStates ..> DeviceCallbacks : flag/variable writes
GlobalStates ..> GpioHelpers : direct pin control

note bottom of GlobalStates
Defined in states.cc / peapod.cc.
Each is an FSM state node; attaching conditionals
is how sensing and actuation are wired together.
end note

note bottom of CoreCallbacks
callback_cycle (on every loop iteration):
1) Chronos.set(millis()) - drives all intervals
2) update fps moving average
3) drain serial via DebugJson::update()
   -> I2CIP::commandRouter (commands)
   -> PeaPod::configRouter (config)

callback_heartbeat (every 5 s):
DebugJson heartbeat + revision + fps/cycle telemetry.

callback_module<M,T> (every 100 ms):
ping MUX M; construct module T on first contact;
operator()() self-check; delete on hard error
(hot-plug behavior).
end note

note bottom of DeviceCallbacks
Template-bound writers: attach to a Flag/Variable
to forward state changes to a specific device
(FQA F, pin/channel P) via the I2CIP devicetree.
end note

@enduml
